      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ba749f34dca6b351d658330|full_name}: You're going to have to provide more information other than \"it happened again\" :)\nPlease make a new post with:\n- Step-by-step instructions to reproduce the problem\n- Output logs\n- Screenshots\n- Video\n- Any other relevant information\nTreat the issue as if you're trying to show us how to make it happen. If we can cause the bug to occur, on our end, it makes it a ton easier to fix. If that isn't possible, documenting what it looks like when the bug happens might help.\nFYI: Your output logs are stored in `C:\\Users\\USERNAME\\AppData\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\vrchat`. They're text files, and they're named `output_log_HH-MM-SS.txt`. The time stamp shows the time at which that log started, so make sure you give us the right one.\nIt's a hidden folder, so you might have some problems tracking it down. Try pasting this into your File Browser address bar: `%AppData\\..\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\vrchat`.\nYou can paste the contents of that file into [pastebin](https://pastebin.com), [gist](https://gist.github.com/), [0bin](https://0bin.net/), or a similar service.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
